      "<work>": "the per-case scratch directory",
      "<tid>": "the thread id in a Rust panic header",
      "0x<pc>": "the program counter in a Go SIGSEGV line"
    },
    "not_normalised": "file names and line:col — `main.rs:5:21` is the span the classifier reads, and it is already relative because each source is compiled from its own temp cwd"
  },
